WEBVTT

00:01.720 --> 00:03.480
If you notice any—

00:03.480 --> 00:05.480
Will! Menel!

00:08.240 --> 00:11.240
The Rust Mountains?

00:11.240 --> 00:14.660
It sounds like things have 
gotten awfully troublesome.

00:14.660 --> 00:18.160
We were hoping the dwarfs 
might know something.

00:18.660 --> 00:23.310
So, how are the immigrants who 
arrived not long ago doing?

00:23.780 --> 00:26.630
They seem to have settled 
in, for the most part.

00:27.550 --> 00:28.980
That's good to hear.

00:30.060 --> 00:35.460
A year ago, when I said our city would 
support the new dwarf arrivals,

00:35.460 --> 00:38.180
it put many of the citizens on their guard.

00:38.760 --> 00:41.570
Well, after what those guys went through...

00:42.020 --> 00:43.010
Yeah...

00:43.010 --> 00:48.080
Perhaps their leader, Agnarr, 
could tell you something?

00:48.080 --> 00:51.530
Perhaps. I'll go see him tomorrow.

01:02.290 --> 01:07.880
The Faraway Paladin

01:04.080 --> 01:07.880
<b><u>The Lord of the Rust Mountains</u></b>

02:25.120 --> 02:31.000
The Last King

02:26.750 --> 02:28.570
Listen to me, Will.

02:28.570 --> 02:31.400
Exactly what are the spirits?

02:31.400 --> 02:33.880
Through the words of the Creator,

02:33.880 --> 02:39.020
water, fire, wind, and trees came 
into existence before man or the gods.

02:39.020 --> 02:42.620
And all of them possessed a 
definite will of their own.

02:42.910 --> 02:44.650
And those were the spirits?

02:44.650 --> 02:46.100
Correct.

02:46.100 --> 02:48.640
And because they had their own will,

02:48.640 --> 02:50.940
they divided themselves into two lines.

02:50.940 --> 02:53.820
One aligned themselves with 
the unstable phenomena

02:53.820 --> 02:55.840
that are the Lords of the Sea 
and the Lords of the Forest,

02:55.840 --> 02:58.620
choosing to live long lives alongside them.

02:58.620 --> 03:02.060
The other chose to live definite 
lives and die definite deaths

03:02.060 --> 03:06.080
as beings with bodies of 
flesh—the human way of life.

03:06.080 --> 03:09.130
Those affiliated with wind, water, and trees

03:09.130 --> 03:12.520
consulted with the goddess 
of the forests, Rhea Silvia,

03:12.520 --> 03:14.800
leading to the birth to the elves.

03:14.800 --> 03:19.350
The spirits of earth, stone, and fire 
longed for human craftsmanship,

03:19.350 --> 03:22.990
so they consulted the god of 
fire and technology, Blaze,

03:22.990 --> 03:25.290
which resulted in the dwarf race.

03:25.290 --> 03:29.240
This is why the dwarfs are 
such excellent craftsmen,

03:29.240 --> 03:31.230
as well as superior warriors.

03:31.230 --> 03:34.210
Yeah, those guys are the real deal.

03:34.860 --> 03:37.450
Tell me more, Blood!

03:37.450 --> 03:40.370
Not sure there's much more to tell.

03:42.040 --> 03:46.150
They're a quiet lot, but they 
know the meaning of courage.

03:46.520 --> 03:49.220
It's constantly on their minds.

03:49.660 --> 03:50.650
What is?

03:50.940 --> 03:56.070
What's worth throwing away 
their own lives to fight for.

03:56.550 --> 04:00.170
They go into battle with 
their very souls on fire.

04:00.680 --> 04:02.920
They don't fear death.

04:04.010 --> 04:07.710
I have genuine respect for dwarven warriors.

04:07.710 --> 04:11.320
The ones I met and fought 
alongside, at least,

04:11.320 --> 04:12.940
were true warriors.

04:24.660 --> 04:25.860
Good morning.

04:25.860 --> 04:28.220
Oh, young master. Good morning.

04:28.220 --> 04:29.720
I'm heading out for morning training.

04:29.720 --> 04:29.980
Of course.

04:31.400 --> 04:33.820
That's some bed head you've got there!

04:43.580 --> 04:44.760
As always...

04:46.410 --> 04:49.150
Your look really doesn't match 
your superhuman strength.

04:49.460 --> 04:52.400
I would've liked to have the looks to match.

04:52.660 --> 04:55.510
You're approachable, though. 
Maybe you're best as you are.

04:55.840 --> 04:59.010
People seek things in others that 
they don't have themselves.

05:00.890 --> 05:03.380
Menel, stay right there for a bit.

05:03.380 --> 05:04.120
Sure.

05:09.300 --> 05:10.570
Good morning.

05:15.050 --> 05:17.180
U-Um...

05:17.720 --> 05:20.300
G-Good... mor...

05:20.700 --> 05:22.680
Would you like to watch before you move on?

05:24.250 --> 05:26.020
U-Um...

05:26.020 --> 05:27.720
Hey. What're you doing?

05:29.340 --> 05:31.550
Who are you? Haven't seen you before.

05:31.900 --> 05:33.600
What's your deal?

05:33.600 --> 05:35.220
If you're that interested, just watch us.

05:35.760 --> 05:39.030
N-No, that's quite all right! 
I'm sorry for intruding!

05:43.770 --> 05:44.980
Menel...

05:44.980 --> 05:47.540
Sorry. That backfired on me.

05:47.940 --> 05:49.300
Yes, it did.

05:49.300 --> 05:51.560
I'm not sure if he was 
interested in our training,

05:51.560 --> 05:54.300
or in the paladin everyone talks about.

05:54.300 --> 05:56.000
Probably the training.

05:56.000 --> 05:58.180
The dwarfs are a warrior race, after all.

05:58.180 --> 06:00.380
He didn't seem like much of a warrior.

06:00.380 --> 06:01.550
You think so?

06:21.720 --> 06:22.940
Welcome.

06:23.300 --> 06:25.060
Thank you for coming.

06:25.310 --> 06:28.020
I'm sorry to visit on such short notice.

06:28.020 --> 06:33.570
Oh, no. There's someone I want 
to introduce to you, as well.

06:33.930 --> 06:37.750
He represents the immigrants who 
recently arrived in this city,

06:37.750 --> 06:41.250
and he is my grand-uncle. 
His name is Grendir.

06:41.250 --> 06:42.710
At your service.

06:43.110 --> 06:46.420
I serve His Highness the Crown 
Prince Ethelbald Southmark,

06:46.420 --> 06:49.500
who has entrusted me with 
governing Beast Woods.

06:49.500 --> 06:51.220
My name is William.

06:52.710 --> 06:55.560
Why did you and your people come here?

06:57.210 --> 06:58.920
To die.

07:00.970 --> 07:02.040
Pardon me...

07:02.040 --> 07:06.430
Uncle Grendir, you will only startle 
him by speaking so frankly.

07:08.090 --> 07:11.070
We haven't long left in this world.

07:11.070 --> 07:14.440
We wish to die with our 
eyes on our homeland.

07:15.570 --> 07:19.230
Uncle Grendir is one of the last survivors 
from the mountains to the west.

07:19.750 --> 07:21.720
The Iron Mountains?

07:22.670 --> 07:27.200
I gaze at those mountains from a distance,

07:27.200 --> 07:30.720
dreaming of the day when we reclaim them.

07:30.720 --> 07:35.440
I would truly die happy if this 
dream could come to pass.

07:36.020 --> 07:39.220
While I realize it may inconvenience you,

07:39.220 --> 07:41.940
I am loath to do any type of work.

07:41.940 --> 07:46.220
If you could just allow me to stay 
in some little corner of the city...

07:47.480 --> 07:51.240
Please rest at ease. 
I'll do everything I can.

07:51.720 --> 07:55.610
I promise I'll protect all 
of you from injustice.

07:59.330 --> 08:03.010
Thank you... Thank you...

08:04.010 --> 08:05.680
Two hundred years ago,

08:05.680 --> 08:09.000
a monarch lived in the Iron Country.

08:09.530 --> 08:11.620
Of short stature and frail constitution,

08:11.620 --> 08:14.020
he did not excel in the martial 
arts and preferred to write.

08:14.020 --> 08:18.000
He was Aurvangr, the last 
king of the Iron Country.

08:18.000 --> 08:20.170
It was an age of peace.

08:20.170 --> 08:23.760
The land was blessed with 
prosperity and well-being.

08:24.290 --> 08:27.460
But then... a storm came.

08:28.230 --> 08:30.920
An invasion by demons from the abyss,

08:30.920 --> 08:34.470
led by the High King of the Eternals.

08:35.020 --> 08:38.470
When the fires of war encroached 
upon the Iron Country,

08:38.470 --> 08:40.550
an emissary of the demons appeared.

08:40.830 --> 08:45.040
That emissary told our people 
to follow the High King.

08:45.360 --> 08:47.380
Today's our last day to answer!

08:47.380 --> 08:49.540
If the only change is who sells us weapons,

08:49.540 --> 08:51.080
does it really matter?

08:51.080 --> 08:53.310
Those demons can't be trusted!

08:53.310 --> 08:55.190
We must fight them to the death!

08:55.190 --> 08:58.180
But if we're dragged into a 
war, our children will die!

08:58.180 --> 09:00.140
What are we to do?

09:03.680 --> 09:05.560
I will make the decision.

09:10.770 --> 09:12.530
What is your answer?

09:16.480 --> 09:17.740
This.

09:21.670 --> 09:23.930
This is the iron you and 
your brethren wanted.

09:23.930 --> 09:26.160
I'll give you as much of it as you want!

09:27.540 --> 09:29.310
The dragon is coming!

09:29.310 --> 09:31.840
Valacirca will destroy all!

09:36.560 --> 09:38.260
I will not allow it.

09:38.260 --> 09:42.240
We will draw the demons of the abyss here 
and slay them all in the bowels of the earth!

09:42.240 --> 09:44.950
This underground corridor 
shall be their tomb!

09:46.560 --> 09:49.950
Those who are not warriors, 
or who are inexperienced warriors,

09:49.950 --> 09:52.440
are to retreat from the Iron Mountains.

09:52.950 --> 09:54.270
My people...

09:54.920 --> 09:56.530
I will die,

09:56.950 --> 10:00.270
and all the warriors who remain 
here will likely die, as well.

10:00.850 --> 10:04.160
But we must not let the Iron Country die!

10:04.160 --> 10:08.800
The pain of issuing such a selfish 
order tears my heart asunder,

10:08.800 --> 10:10.970
yet I issue it regardless!

10:10.970 --> 10:14.680
Even if you lose your homeland and 
drown in regret and disgrace...

10:14.660 --> 10:15.790
Live!

10:16.160 --> 10:20.050
That is the battle I order you to fight!

10:20.050 --> 10:22.320
You are not running away!

10:22.320 --> 10:25.050
You are simply given command 
over a different battlefield!

10:25.440 --> 10:29.230
We, the king and warriors, 
to protect our name and our pride,

10:29.230 --> 10:31.910
will die in these mountains where 
our ancestral spirits sleep!

10:31.910 --> 10:35.760
All of you must abandon your pride 
and wager everything on living!

10:35.760 --> 10:38.060
Do not let the flames in our kilns die!

10:38.450 --> 10:43.270
Live! Live and fight until 
we make our comeback!

10:43.270 --> 10:46.580
That is my last order!

10:50.180 --> 10:54.350
This is the legend of the Iron 
Mountains that has been handed down.

10:55.150 --> 10:59.100
I wasn't even born yet at the time.

10:59.100 --> 11:02.920
We had only just become royal guards.

11:02.920 --> 11:06.850
We didn't even get to fight. 
We could only obey his order...

11:06.850 --> 11:08.620
and with the common folk...

11:12.710 --> 11:16.870
Amid the bitter cold and 
the treacherous path,

11:16.870 --> 11:18.360
my child...

11:18.890 --> 11:23.620
A cheerful child, all smiles, 
who encouraged all of us to keep going...

11:23.620 --> 11:28.350
could not even smile any longer, 
and then... passed away.

11:28.910 --> 11:33.160
I can no longer even remember how many died.

11:33.630 --> 11:36.460
And yet... I lived!

11:36.460 --> 11:40.880
I overcame that time of 
chaos and lived 200 years!

11:41.630 --> 11:46.450
And you have now returned this 
land to the hands of man.

11:46.450 --> 11:50.100
Not only that, but you 
even shed tears with me.

11:50.880 --> 11:55.640
We can return home someday. 
We can fulfill the words of our king.

11:56.120 --> 12:00.560
How noble it is to continue 
believing such thoughts...

12:03.210 --> 12:05.030
Sir William...

12:05.470 --> 12:07.220
Thank you...

12:08.600 --> 12:10.570
Thank you...

12:13.010 --> 12:16.920
<i>Aurvangr, the king of the Iron Country, huh?</i>

12:16.920 --> 12:18.510
<i>And what is this dragon?</i>

12:21.880 --> 12:22.870
Bastard!

12:24.280 --> 12:25.430
Stop it!

12:25.430 --> 12:27.180
That hurt, damn it!

12:25.950 --> 12:27.970
Stop!

12:28.670 --> 12:30.020
Damn you!

12:29.350 --> 12:31.260
You're causing a disturbance!

12:30.020 --> 12:31.430
Piece of dung!

12:31.260 --> 12:32.420
Take this outside!

12:33.190 --> 12:35.070
Shut yer hole, damn it!

12:35.070 --> 12:37.280
Hey! Hold him still!

12:44.550 --> 12:45.630
Stop this.

12:45.630 --> 12:47.140
Huh?! Shut up!

12:47.140 --> 12:48.280
The hell?!

12:48.280 --> 12:50.450
I won't let you take this any farther.

12:52.860 --> 12:56.000
You two have just had a bit 
too much to drink, right?

12:57.450 --> 12:59.470
We're sorry for the disturbance!

12:59.470 --> 13:00.960
Please take this and spare us!

13:15.000 --> 13:17.120
Ah, you're awake?

13:21.150 --> 13:22.290
What's your name?

13:25.410 --> 13:26.760
It's... Ru.

13:26.760 --> 13:28.260
Ru, eh?

13:28.260 --> 13:32.650
You might already know, but I'm 
William. Nice to meet you.

13:33.350 --> 13:35.920
Yeah, looks like everything's fine.

13:36.400 --> 13:40.150
It's amazing that you're not even 
scratched after taking that many hits.

13:40.150 --> 13:42.870
My toughness is the one thing 
I've got going for me.

13:44.730 --> 13:46.240
Are you the owner?

13:46.680 --> 13:49.180
Allow me to apologize for the commotion.

13:49.420 --> 13:51.820
My father is sick in bed.

13:51.820 --> 13:55.380
I couldn't stop them on my own.

13:55.380 --> 13:56.820
Shall I examine him?

13:56.820 --> 13:59.030
What?! I couldn't ask that of you!

13:59.280 --> 14:00.760
I don't mind.

14:00.760 --> 14:04.020
If I knew someone was ill and did nothing,

14:04.020 --> 14:06.820
the goddess would be furious with me.

14:08.270 --> 14:12.060
Ru, I'll be right back. Please rest a while.

14:12.060 --> 14:13.020
All right...

14:25.850 --> 14:27.830
I think you'll be fine now.

14:29.720 --> 14:31.630
Thank you so much!

14:31.630 --> 14:34.480
I received this power from 
the goddess of light.

14:34.480 --> 14:35.890
You can thank her.

14:35.890 --> 14:37.700
Of course!

14:37.700 --> 14:41.840
Oh, I know! Please let us 
provide a meal for you!

14:41.840 --> 14:42.770
Please!

14:43.360 --> 14:45.070
I'd appreciate that.

14:45.070 --> 14:48.140
I actually forgot to have dinner tonight.

14:52.020 --> 14:53.740
What are you doing?

14:59.060 --> 15:00.800
Wow, this is amazing.

15:02.270 --> 15:06.020
It's really nothing, compared to you.

15:06.020 --> 15:08.240
You're so strong and courageous...

15:08.240 --> 15:11.040
You shouldn't say things like that.

15:11.040 --> 15:11.760
Huh?

15:13.890 --> 15:18.390
Don't curse yourself by saying 
you're weak and cowardly.

15:19.090 --> 15:23.270
Why don't you try being your 
own strongest supporter?

15:27.420 --> 15:28.150
I...

15:28.430 --> 15:29.340
I will!

15:34.660 --> 15:36.550
Enjoy it before it gets cold.

15:36.550 --> 15:38.250
Thank you!

15:39.920 --> 15:41.830
Earth-Mother Mater,

15:41.830 --> 15:43.630
and all the virtuous gods,

15:43.630 --> 15:47.780
we give thanks for your grace 
as we partake in this meal.

15:48.240 --> 15:49.700
Please bless the food before us.

15:51.020 --> 15:53.300
Now, then... Cheers.

15:54.450 --> 15:55.960
Ch-Cheers.

16:01.290 --> 16:03.170
Delicious.

16:03.170 --> 16:03.860
It is!

16:04.640 --> 16:07.010
So, tell me, why were you here?

16:07.530 --> 16:10.260
W-Well... um...

16:10.900 --> 16:15.010
I-I just migrated here, and well...

16:15.010 --> 16:18.750
I wanted to get my bearings... 
you might say... so... um...

16:19.180 --> 16:21.620
I was sort of... exploring...

16:21.620 --> 16:24.760
I don't think that's such 
an odd thing to do.

16:24.760 --> 16:28.630
But... all the others in my 
clan are keeping busy...

16:28.630 --> 16:30.310
You mean Grendir?

16:31.570 --> 16:33.500
You don't need to worry about that.

16:33.500 --> 16:37.300
I just came from speaking 
with him and Agnarr.

16:39.990 --> 16:42.400
You are... remarkable.

16:42.400 --> 16:44.630
So strong and dependable...

16:45.110 --> 16:47.270
Nothing like me at all.

16:47.270 --> 16:49.690
Then why don't you try it, too?

16:49.690 --> 16:50.330
Huh?

16:52.530 --> 16:56.310
You can get a certain degree of 
strength by eating well and training.

16:56.310 --> 16:58.770
Dependability comes from your conduct 
and getting used to things.

16:59.310 --> 17:01.700
There must be a reason we met here this way.

17:01.700 --> 17:05.040
If you wouldn't mind... I mean, if you want,

17:05.040 --> 17:09.840
why don't you help me out as, 
say, something like a thane?

17:10.860 --> 17:13.340
U-Um, do you really mean...

17:14.160 --> 17:18.580
If there's anything you truly long to do,

17:18.580 --> 17:20.450
I want to help you do it.

17:24.570 --> 17:28.430
I might cause trouble for you, but...

17:30.780 --> 17:33.720
Please... let me learn from you!

17:46.950 --> 17:48.260
Young master!

17:48.260 --> 17:50.480
Where have you been?!

17:50.480 --> 17:52.540
When you go somewhere, you must tell us!

17:52.540 --> 17:55.260
Regardless, I'm so glad you're safe!

17:55.260 --> 17:56.540
I'm sorry...

17:59.360 --> 18:01.690
Ru has been raised with great care.

17:59.540 --> 18:01.110
We were worried about you!

18:01.110 --> 18:03.310
Do you understand?!

18:02.310 --> 18:05.190
Perhaps too great, even.

18:09.130 --> 18:12.700
Anyway, you must never do 
something like this again!

18:12.700 --> 18:13.810
Pardon me.

18:16.440 --> 18:20.250
My name is William G. Maryblood.

18:22.270 --> 18:23.910
Allow me to apologize.

18:24.310 --> 18:27.210
I met Ru by chance, but we 
happened to hit it off,

18:27.210 --> 18:29.970
and I kept him for quite 
a long time just to talk.

18:29.970 --> 18:31.500
Not at all...

18:31.500 --> 18:33.210
That's the paladin?

18:33.480 --> 18:35.340
He's dreadfully strong!

18:35.760 --> 18:37.350
He's more than just strong.

18:37.750 --> 18:40.850
He could crush everyone here.

18:42.050 --> 18:44.040
My name is Ghelreis.

18:44.040 --> 18:47.920
I accept the apology you've given 
on behalf of our young master.

18:47.920 --> 18:50.070
You have my most humble thanks.

18:50.070 --> 18:52.810
Now... what brings you here?

18:52.810 --> 18:56.310
I would like to make Ru my thane.

18:57.150 --> 18:59.030
You want to make the young master a thane?!

18:59.030 --> 19:02.950
But that would mean he'd have to 
accompany you on beast hunts!

19:02.950 --> 19:06.110
Young master! Being the paladin's 
thane is too dangerous!

19:06.510 --> 19:08.680
Please give this more thought!

19:10.610 --> 19:12.210
What do <i>you</i> want to do?

19:23.230 --> 19:24.630
I-I...

19:25.560 --> 19:28.980
I want to learn from him!

19:32.680 --> 19:36.310
I want to find what a warrior 
is, what courage is,

19:36.310 --> 19:38.900
with my own two hands!

19:38.900 --> 19:43.560
If I never face danger or even 
take a single step on my own,

19:43.560 --> 19:45.990
what can I know about being a warrior?!

19:45.990 --> 19:48.850
What can I know about courage?!

19:48.850 --> 19:52.080
Before our ancestral spirits and gods,

19:52.080 --> 19:54.090
I want to be someone I won't be ashamed of!

19:54.090 --> 19:58.220
If I know nothing of battle, courage, 
or conducting myself nobly,

19:58.220 --> 20:00.230
how can I call myself a dwarf?!

20:00.230 --> 20:04.210
I have no intention of 
reversing this decision!

20:10.870 --> 20:12.180
<i>Wow...</i>

20:12.180 --> 20:13.360
Sir Will!

20:13.360 --> 20:17.370
Please accept me as your 
thane right here and now!

20:28.400 --> 20:32.470
I will guard with my own hands 
the loyalty that you offer now.

20:40.370 --> 20:43.380
Brief though it was, he has 
given me his oath as a thane.

20:43.380 --> 20:47.880
Thus, as the knight he serves, 
I will hear what you have to say.

20:48.940 --> 20:52.190
Our young master will be the 
Faraway Paladin's thane...

20:52.190 --> 20:53.640
So it must be.

20:54.330 --> 20:56.230
You're agreeing to this?!

20:56.230 --> 20:58.790
Since he was young, he has 
asked no selfish favors of us

20:58.790 --> 21:01.830
out of concern for the 
predicament we have lived in.

21:01.830 --> 21:04.160
And this is what he desires.

21:06.980 --> 21:11.520
Young master, I will 
explain this to Grendir.

21:11.520 --> 21:13.050
Th-Thank you.

21:13.050 --> 21:19.000
However, as of today, 
you are as a dead man to me.

21:19.800 --> 21:21.060
B-But—

21:21.060 --> 21:24.080
Now that you have entrusted your 
loyalty to a great warrior,

21:24.080 --> 21:27.750
you must not, under any circumstances, 
value your life above his.

21:27.750 --> 21:29.020
Serve him faithfully,

21:29.020 --> 21:33.800
prepared to die for him without hesitation 
if it ever becomes necessary.

21:35.330 --> 21:36.680
Understand?

21:39.780 --> 21:41.150
I understand!

21:42.200 --> 21:45.900
Grendir and I will ask after you later.

21:46.330 --> 21:48.300
Take care of our young master.

21:48.300 --> 21:50.290
